       CALL-ZEN08533-001.
               CALL 'ZEN08533' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZEN08533 FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CALL-ZEN07703-002.
